Base data structures for gathering data from each user, as well as creating a database of plants as they get indentified. Also connected Wikipedia to our project to give descriptions about each plant. 

- create.sql: wrote the 5 database tables: users (login info + points), plants (common name, scientific name, description), users_to_plants (which plants each user found, with photo, location, and date), badges (name, description, number of plants required), and users_to_badges (which badges each user earned). Used foreign keys with ON DELETE CASCADE so deleting a user removes their data.
